silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_03_typed_verb_discipline_sections_03_verb_taxonomy_concrete_anchor_4_measurement_v#ismeasuredbyarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The IsMeasuredByArrow is is-measured-by is a measurement-aspect arrow. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'measurement_v', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
